#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/0-index.md:3
#: cc6d8d07a9824f38b1685cb896e91c46
msgid ""
"**Basic Joint Controller** joint-position FSM (HOME / HOLD / MOVEJ). "
"`/fsm_command` is `std_msgs/Int32` — on mixed OCS2/WBC stacks `3` means "
"**OCS2**; canonical MOVEJ is `4`."
msgstr ""
"**Basic Joint Controller** 关节位置 FSM（HOME / HOLD / MOVEJ）。`/fsm_command` 是"
" `std_msgs/Int32` — 混合 OCS2/WBC 栈上 `3` 表示 **OCS2**；规范 MOVEJ 是 `4`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/0-index.md:5
#: 0573502dfab0407cbc2a6b5a3ff9e978
msgid ""
"Parameter YAML, `ros2 param` inspection, and Startup vs Runtime: "
"[Configure ROS 2 controller parameters](12-ros2_parameters.md). Tables: "
"[Controller ROS 2 "
"parameters](../../4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md)."
msgstr ""
"参数 YAML、`ros2 param` 查看，以及仅启动 vs 运行时：[配置 ROS 2 "
"控制器参数](12-ros2_parameters.md)。表格：[控制器 ROS 2 "
"参数](../../4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/0-index.md:7
#: 0d3cf321a78b473f8ce7efd1dcf307a2
msgid ""
"Real-arm contact: [How to use impedance control](13-force_control.md). "
"Panthera HT and ARX use MIT-mode force control. Tianji and Rokae use "
"vendor joint impedance, and payload identification is on that path."
msgstr "真机接触：[如何使用阻抗控制](13-force_control.md)。Panthera HT 和方舟无限走 MIT 力控。天机和珞石走厂商关节阻抗，负载辨识也在这条路径上。"
